<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
        <title>Verify your email address</title>
    </head>
    {# Inline styles throughout: email clients ignore stylesheets. The colours
       are the app's brand tokens (assets/styles/app.css), written out because
       custom properties do not survive most clients either. #}
    <body style="margin: 0; padding: 32px 16px; background: #f7f5f2; font-family: -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #14181d;">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e6e2db; border-radius: 12px;">
            <tr>
                <td style="padding: 28px 32px;">
                    <p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #12756a;">Booking Calendar</p>
                    <h1 style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.3; color: #14181d;">Verify your email address</h1>

                    <p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55;">Hi {{ firstName }},</p>
                    <p style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55;">
                        Follow the link below to finish creating your account. It is valid for
                        {{ lifetimeMinutes }} minutes.
                    </p>

                    <p style="margin: 0 0 28px;">
                        <a href="{{ url }}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 22px; background: #16897c; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;">Verify email address</a>
                    </p>

                    <p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: #5c6672;">
                        If the button does not work, copy this address into your browser:
                    </p>
                    <p style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all;">
                        <a href="{{ url }}" style="color: #12756a;">{{ url }}</a>
                    </p>

                    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: #5c6672;">
                        If you did not create an account, ignore this email. Nothing happens until the
                        link is followed.
                    </p>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </body>
</html>
